WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.508 --> 00:00:16.472
A guard stood inside True Savings Bank.

2
00:00:17.572 --> 00:00:18.452
He looked at his watch.

3
00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:21.233
"It's time to open the bank."

4
00:00:25.794 --> 00:00:27.455
He unlocked the door and pushed it open.

5
00:00:30.135 --> 00:00:32.076
Several large figures stood in the entrance.

6
00:00:34.412 --> 00:00:35.573
"Arr!" one figure growled.

7
00:00:35.593 --> 00:00:37.754
"Give us all your loot!"

8
00:00:41.277 --> 00:00:41.857
"It's this way."

9
00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:43.698
Jack was looking at his phone.

10
00:00:43.718 --> 00:00:44.679
"Follow me!"

11
00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.261
Roxy and her friends were on a scavenger hunt.

12
00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.664
Jack was using his phone to locate a box.

13
00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:56.067
Someone had hidden the box in Metro City Park.

14
00:00:57.788 --> 00:00:59.569
"What do you think will be in the box?"

15
00:00:59.929 --> 00:01:00.570
Mara asked.

16
00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:03.752
"I hope it's something cool," Terrell said.

17
00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.201
"Maybe the box is filled with candy!"

18
00:01:06.221 --> 00:01:08.723
"I hope it's treasure!"

19
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:11.204
Jack said, still looking down at his phone.

20
00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.546
"Now we need to turn right."

21
00:01:18.068 --> 00:01:19.929
would be awesome," Terrell said.

22
00:01:19.949 --> 00:01:21.730
"We'd all be rich!"

23
00:01:23.071 --> 00:01:23.832
Roxy laughed.

24
00:01:24.632 --> 00:01:26.313
"I doubt we'll find treasure.

25
00:01:26.973 --> 00:01:28.894
The box will probably just have a note.

26
00:01:29.615 --> 00:01:31.136
And maybe some bird feathers."

27
00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.253
Jack turned onto a path.

28
00:01:35.914 --> 00:01:37.815
He looked closely at his phone as he walked.

29
00:01:39.656 --> 00:01:41.056
Mara gave him a worried look.

30
00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:43.698
"Watch where you're walking, Jack.

31
00:01:44.058 --> 00:01:45.058
You might—" "Oof!"

32
00:01:45.479 --> 00:01:46.799
Jack tripped over a tree root.

33
00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.381
The phone flew out of his hand as he fell.

34
00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:51.902
He sat up and grinned at Mara.

35
00:01:51.922 --> 00:01:55.024
"I might trip over something?"

36
00:01:58.305 --> 00:01:59.666
Terrell picked up Jack's phone.

37
00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:02.728
"Don't worry.

38
00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.201
It's not broken."

39
00:02:04.761 --> 00:02:05.922
He handed it back to Jack.

40
00:02:08.423 --> 00:02:09.544
They walked a little farther.

41
00:02:11.505 --> 00:02:13.165
Then Jack stopped and scratched his head.

42
00:02:13.185 --> 00:02:15.627
"I think we went the wrong way."

43
00:02:16.507 --> 00:02:17.928
He groaned as he looked at his phone.

44
00:02:17.948 --> 00:02:20.349
"This map doesn't make any sense."

45
00:02:20.369 --> 00:02:24.632
"It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here," Terrell said.

46
00:02:24.652 --> 00:02:27.673
"I bet she could find the box really fast!"

47
00:02:28.194 --> 00:02:29.194
He stared at Roxy.

48
00:02:29.674 --> 00:02:30.455
"Right, Roxy?"

49
00:02:31.775 --> 00:02:32.476
Roxy gulped.

50
00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:34.572
"Uh-oh," she thought.

51
00:02:34.592 --> 00:02:36.173
"I think he knows!"

52
00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:37.833
Mara laughed.

53
00:02:38.694 --> 00:02:41.334
"Rocket Girl has better things to do, Terrell."

54
00:02:41.354 --> 00:02:43.655
"Yeah," Jack said.

55
00:02:43.675 --> 00:02:46.456
"She's always busy fighting super villains."

56
00:02:47.516 --> 00:02:48.536
Roxy quickly nodded.

57
00:02:48.556 --> 00:02:53.518
"Right! Rocket Girl has, um, other things to do."

58
00:02:54.498 --> 00:02:55.258
Terrell shrugged.

59
00:02:55.278 --> 00:03:00.700
"Maybe. But if she was here, she could definitely find the box for us.

60
00:03:02.076 --> 00:03:05.098
She could use her x-ray vision and see right through everything."

61
00:03:06.639 --> 00:03:07.639
Roxy's watch beeped.

62
00:03:07.659 --> 00:03:13.703
"Oh, I dropped my water bottle somewhere," she said.

63
00:03:13.723 --> 00:03:15.604
"You guys go ahead.

64
00:03:16.244 --> 00:03:17.165
I'll catch up to you."

65
00:03:22.948 --> 00:03:24.469
Roxy pressed a button on her watch.

66
00:03:24.489 --> 00:03:28.051
"Mayor Bloom.

67
00:03:28.311 --> 00:03:28.972
What's wrong?"

68
00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.862
"Rocket Girl," the mayor said.

69
00:03:31.882 --> 00:03:34.345
"True Savings Bank was just robbed.

70
00:03:35.166 --> 00:03:36.287
We need your help!"

71
00:03:37.328 --> 00:03:38.069
Roxy nodded.

72
00:03:38.089 --> 00:03:40.691
"You can count on me, Mayor!"
